# Runtime status files describe a job on ONE machine. Uploading them makes the
# deployed dashboard report a scan that is not running there, which is how a
# dead local scan showed as stuck at 5/1138 on the live site.
data/scan-status.json
data/backtest-status.json

# Caches rebuilt on demand; several MB each and never read by the website.
data/edgar-history-cache.json
data/sp500-membership.json
data/delisted-cik-cache.json

*.log
